OL,3,GNEWSANew Burns statue planned outside
OL,4,Atown where he died
OL,5,
OL,6,FA carved wooden statue of Robert Burns
OL,7,Fis being proposed to welcome visitors
OL,8,Fto the south of Scotland town where he
OL,9,Fdied.
OL,11,FThe plans would see the sculpture of
OL,12,FScotland's national poet - with a
OL,13,Fplough and holding a mouse - put up
OL,14,Fnext to the A76 on the outskirts of
OL,15,FDumfries.
OL,17,FThe application to put up the structure
OL,18,Fhas been submitted by community
OL,19,Fimprovements group The People's
OL,20,FProject.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
